{"id":"663084","name":"西红柿山药疙瘩汤","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"","cover":"images/663084/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药","amount":"1段"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"山药去皮切碎末。","img":"images/663084/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"分次加入面粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663084/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"使每个山药碎粒上都裹上面粉。","img":"images/663084/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"西红柿去皮切碎。","img":"images/663084/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"辅食锅里放油烧热，放入西红柿炒出汁水。","img":"images/663084/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加生抽，热水烧开。","img":"images/663084/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入山药粒煮开。","img":"images/663084/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"中火煮5分钟左右山药粒熟透再加入圆白菜碎煮开即可。","img":"images/663084/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"关火加盐，香油调味。","img":"images/663084/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/663084/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}